# SPA fallback: serve index.html for any path that is not a real asset so
# client-side routes (/studio, /product/gitall) resolve on a hard load or a
# direct crawl instead of 404ing.
#
# This does not affect /api/* — redirects are not applied to requests served
# by Pages Functions, so functions/api/analytics keeps handling its own routes.

# Renamed products. These must sit above the SPA fallback: Cloudflare applies
# the first rule that matches.
